Building CorgiCoin
==================

CorgiCoin builds with CMake. See BUILD.cmake.md for full, current
instructions covering the daemon (corgicoind) and the Qt wallet
(corgicoin-qt) on Linux, macOS, and Windows.

Quick start
-----------

    mkdir build && cd build
    cmake .. -DCMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release
    cmake --build . -j

Common options:
    -DBUILD_QT_GUI=ON|OFF    build the Qt5/6 wallet (default ON)
    -DBUILD_TESTS=ON|OFF     build the unit test suite

Dependencies: C++17 compiler, OpenSSL 3.x, Boost 1.55+, Berkeley DB 5.3+,
and (for the GUI) Qt 5.15+ or Qt 6. See BUILD.cmake.md for details.
